      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "As a non‑profit, the society is dedicated to preserving Maugansville’s history and the surrounding area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://museumsdatabase.com/museums/view/13736",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Its research library is open to the public, offering a wealth of historical information about Maugansville’s people.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://museumsdatabase.com/museums/view/13736",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The society’s headquarters sits in a historic building on Maugans Avenue that once housed the town’s post office.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://museumsdatabase.com/museums/view/13736",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Museum exhibits showcase early farming, industry, schools, churches, and notable residents who shaped Maugansville.",
